            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "To be able to? (توانستن, tavânestan.) A skill? (مهارت, mahârat.) Ability? (توانایی, tavânâyi.) A right? (حق, hagh.) A chance? (فرصت, forsat.) A tool? (ابزار, abzâr.) An owner? (صاحب, sâheb.) Power? (قدرت, ghodrat.) A wish? (آرزو, ârezu.) Hope? (امید, omid.) A plan? (برنامه, barnâme.) A need? (نیاز, niyâz.) A decision? (تصمیم, tasmim.) A goal? (هدف, hadaf.) A request? (خواهش, khâhesh.) Why?? (چرا, cherâ.) Because? (زیرا, zirâ.) Because? (چون, chon.) A reason? (دلیل, dalil.) A cause? (سبب, sabab.) Therefore? (بنابراین, banâbarin.) A pillow? (بالش, bâlesh.) A blanket? (پتو, patu.) A curtain? (پرده, parde.) A nail? (میخ, mikh.)"
            }
          ]
        }
